<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65355" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεγᾰλεῖ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέγας</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>magnificent, splendid</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					2.1.34
				</span></i>
			 (
				Comp.
			); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτῆμα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				4.5.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. τι διαπεπραγμένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					<u>Per.Fr.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				2.6
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίστιν -οτάταν</span> prob. in
			Paean ap. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Flam.</u>
				16
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				<u>Coll.Alex.</u>
				p.173
			</span></i> P.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ μ. τῶν πράξεων, τῆς
				ἀθανασίας</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				8.1.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				798.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>, cf. Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				70.1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ μ.</span>
			<i>mighty works</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>De.</u>
				11.2
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Act.Ap.</u>
				2.11
			</span></i>. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ως</span>
			<i>greatly</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠφελῶν τὴν πόλιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Ages.</u>
					11.16
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.87.5
			</span></i>; <i>magnificently</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. εἴρηκας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Hp.Ma.</u>
					291e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀψωνεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					192
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοὺς μ. τιμᾶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					11.9
				</span></i>
			: 
				Comp.
			 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ότερον</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				168c
			</span></i>; -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οτέρως</span>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, γαμεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					4.1.9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of persons,
				<i>stately, haughty</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				4.1.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ μ. τινός</span>, as a title,
				<i>Highness,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				POxy.
				1204.10
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> of style, <i>elevated</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Demetr.
				<u>Eloc.</u>
				14
			</span></i>, al. Adv.
			
				Sup.
			 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ότατα</span>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ἑρμηνεῦσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VS</u>
					1.21.1
				</span></i>
			.</div>
